  "scope": "C329 keeps original owner-private eight-byte fingerprint/index table, full bitmap and entire parser/queue/hash/roles. For records mapping<=UINT32MAX only, pack exact32-bit offset and raw key length into existing64-bit header, borrow full immutable mapped key instead of copying to block payload; wider mapping/default model constructor keeps exact old owned layout. Bounds/address/length checked before packing. Private blocks/index/growth/country API unchanged except bytes reconstructs original slice. All keys still actual input and full equality, no catalogue/truncated domain. Claimed aim less unique-key payload/copy work; native time/M/source/K unknown. Need new borrowed/owned fallback/header/offsetMAX/empty/long/input lifetime/full equality/all-country/grow/index/guard/strict/race/GCC/image/default/all29 proof if warranted. No seed/resultcache/host/harness/counter/flags/PGO changes.",
